      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\n\n\nNo. 39, 2015\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data\nRetention) Act 2015\n\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 1  Data retention",
      "skos:definition": "Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\n\n\nNo. 39, 2015\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data\nRetention) Act 2015\n\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 1  Data retention",
