    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187aa",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "187AA Information to be kept",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187aa"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The following table sets out the kinds of information that a service\nprovider must keep, or cause to be kept, under subsection 187A(1):\n\nKinds of information to be kept\nItem\nTopic\nColumn 1\nDescription of information\nColumn 2\nThe subscriber of,\nand accounts,\nservices,\ntelecommunications\ndevices and other\nrelevant services\nrelating to, the\nrelevant service\nThe following:\n(a) any information that is one or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) any name or address information;\n(ii) any other information for identification\npurposes;\nrelating to the relevant service, being\ninformation used by the service provider for the\npurposes of identifying the subscriber of the\nrelevant service;\n(b) any information relating to any contract,\nagreement or arrangement relating to the\nrelevant service, or to any related account,\nservice or device;\n(c) any information that is one or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) billing or payment information;\n(ii) contact information;\nrelating to the relevant service, being\ninformation used by the service provider in\nrelation to the relevant service;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 1  Data retention",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The following table sets out the kinds of information that a service\nprovider must keep, or cause to be kept, under subsection 187A(1):\n\nKinds of information to be kept\nItem\nTopic\nColumn 1\nDescription of information\nColumn 2\nThe subscriber of,\nand accounts,\nservices,\ntelecommunications\ndevices and other\nrelevant services\nrelating to, the\nrelevant service\nThe following:\n(a) any information that is one or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) any name or address information;\n(ii) any other information for identification\npurposes;\nrelating to the relevant service, being\ninformation used by the service provider for the\npurposes of identifying the subscriber of the\nrelevant service;\n(b) any information relating to any contract,\nagreement or arrangement relating to the\nrelevant service, or to any related account,\nservice or device;\n(c) any information that is one or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) billing or payment information;\n(ii) contact information;\nrelating to the relevant service, being\ninformation used by the service provider in\nrelation to the relevant service;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 1  Data retention",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187aa-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187aa-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3854998ff6dcfca3aa0d19ad3ff1a7adcbd1088b85ee8cb6a4870b345eb21381",
      "skos:note": "Service provider must keep certain information about subscribers and services.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187aa",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "187AA Information to be kept",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 11,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The following table sets out the kinds of information that a service\nprovider must keep, or cause to be kept, under subsection 187A(1):\n\nKinds of information to be kept\nItem\nTopic\nColumn 1\nDescription of information\nColumn 2\nThe subscriber of,\nand accounts,\nservices,\ntelecommunications\ndevices and other\nrelevant services\nrelating to, the\nrelevant service\nThe following:\n(a) any information that is one or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) any name or address information;\n(ii) any other information for identification\npurposes;\nrelating to the relevant service, being\ninformation used by the service provider for the\npurposes of identifying the subscriber of the\nrelevant service;\n(b) any information relating to any contract,\nagreement or arrangement relating to the\nrelevant service, or to any related account,\nservice or device;\n(c) any information that is one or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) billing or payment information;\n(ii) contact information;\nrelating to the relevant service, being\ninformation used by the service provider in\nrelation to the relevant service;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 1  Data retention"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187aa-norm",
