      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Consultation with Privacy Commissioner is required",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Declaration cannot be made without consultation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187b-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "187B(3) Certain service providers not covered by this Part",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187b-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In considering whether to make the declaration, the\nCommunications Access Co-ordinator must have regard to:\n\n(a) the interests of law enforcement and national security; and\n\n(b) the objects of the Telecommunications Act 1997; and\n\n(ba) the objects of the Privacy Act 1988; and\n\n(bb) any submissions made by the Privacy Commissioner because\nof the consultation under subsection (2A); and\n\n(c) any other matter that the Communications Access\nCo-ordinator considers relevant.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In considering whether to make the declaration, the\nCommunications Access Co-ordinator must have regard to:\n\n(a) the interests of law enforcement and national security; and\n\n(b) the objects of the Telecommunications Act 1997; and\n\n(ba) the objects of the Privacy Act 1988; and\n\n(bb) any submissions made by the Privacy Commissioner because\nof the consultation under subsection (2A); and\n\n(c) any other matter that the Communications Access\nCo-ordinator considers relevant.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187b-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1cfbda2e8df04ae742761de5089ea987083e10248ea13566025426b202ef4d8a",
      "skos:note": "Consider interests of law enforcement and national security, Telecommunications Act 1997, Privacy Act 1988, and submissions from the Privacy Commissioner."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187b-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "187B(3) Certain service providers not covered by this Part",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "(3) In considering whether to make the declaration, the\nCommunications Access Co-ordinator must have regard to:\n\n(a) the interests of law enforcement and national security; and\n\n(b) the objects of the Telecommunications Act 1997; and\n\n(ba) the objects of the Privacy Act 1988; and\n\n(bb) any submissions made by the Privacy Commissioner because\nof the consultation under subsection (2A); and\n\n(c) any other matter that the Communications Access\nCo-ordinator considers relevant."
    },
