      "values:originalText": "(5) A declaration made under subsection (2) is not a legislative\ninstrument.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nData retention  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 39, 2015\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data\nRetention) Act 2015",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A declaration made under subsection (2) is not a legislative\ninstrument.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nData retention  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 39, 2015\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data\nRetention) Act 2015",
