    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187g-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "187G(6) Consultation with agencies and the ACMA",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187g-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Communications Access Co-ordinator must:\n\n(a) if, on receipt of a determination under paragraph (5)(b), the\nservice provider amends the original plan to take account of\nthat determination and gives the amended plan to the\nCommunications Access Co-ordinator—approve the plan as\namended, and notify the service provider of the approval; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 1  Data retention",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The Communications Access Co-ordinator must:\n\n(a) if, on receipt of a determination under paragraph (5)(b), the\nservice provider amends the original plan to take account of\nthat determination and gives the amended plan to the\nCommunications Access Co-ordinator—approve the plan as\namended, and notify the service provider of the approval; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 1  Data retention",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187g"
      },
