        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cf0c4b622ce7d580814c1a81e26b2bb5904bec485c1b423cebd9c547aac57d4e",
      "skos:note": "Approve amended plan and notify service provider of approval"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187g-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "187G(6) Consultation with agencies and the ACMA",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Communications Access Co-ordinator must:\n\n(a) if, on receipt of a determination under paragraph (5)(b), the\nservice provider amends the original plan to take account of\nthat determination and gives the amended plan to the\nCommunications Access Co-ordinator—approve the plan as\namended, and notify the service provider of the approval; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 1  Data retention"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187g-ss-6-norm",
