      "skos:note": "Amendment of data retention implementation plans requires approval from the Communications Access Co-ordinator."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187j-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "187J(1) Amending data retention implementation plans",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a service provider’s data retention implementation plan is in\nforce, it may be amended only if:\n\n(a) the service provider applies to the Communications Access\nCo-ordinator for approval of the amendment, and the\nCo-ordinator approves the amendment; or\n\n(b) the Co-ordinator makes a request to the service provider for\nthe amendment to be made, and the service provider agrees to\nthe amendment."
    },
