      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Section 187F applies in relation to approval of the amendment\nunder paragraph (1)(a) as if the application for approval of the\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nData retention  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 39, 2015\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data\nRetention) Act 2015\n\namendment were an application under section 187E for approval of\na data retention implementation plan.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Section 187F applies in relation to approval of the amendment\nunder paragraph (1)(a) as if the application for approval of the\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nData retention  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 39, 2015\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data\nRetention) Act 2015\n\namendment were an application under section 187E for approval of\na data retention implementation plan.",
