    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187j-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "187J(3) Amending data retention implementation plans",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187j-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(3) An amendment of a data retention implementation plan:\n\n(a) comes into force when:\n\n(i) if paragraph (1)(a) applies—the Co-ordinator notifies\nthe service provider of the approval of the amendment;\nor\n\n(ii) if paragraph (1)(b) applies—the service provider\nnotifies the Co-ordinator of the service provider’s\nagreement to the amendment; but\n\n(b) does not effect when the plan ceases to be in force under\nparagraph 187H(1)(b).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) An amendment of a data retention implementation plan:\n\n(a) comes into force when:\n\n(i) if paragraph (1)(a) applies—the Co-ordinator notifies\nthe service provider of the approval of the amendment;\nor\n\n(ii) if paragraph (1)(b) applies—the service provider\nnotifies the Co-ordinator of the service provider’s\nagreement to the amendment; but\n\n(b) does not effect when the plan ceases to be in force under\nparagraph 187H(1)(b).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187j"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187j-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1fa0d903c4a31ca3443af2632da17e24688ba4074232af2f8593611878e3bfff",
      "skos:note": "Amendment of data retention implementation plan comes into force under specific conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187j-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "187J(3) Amending data retention implementation plans",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(3) An amendment of a data retention implementation plan:\n\n(a) comes into force when:\n\n(i) if paragraph (1)(a) applies—the Co-ordinator notifies\nthe service provider of the approval of the amendment;\nor\n\n(ii) if paragraph (1)(b) applies—the service provider\nnotifies the Co-ordinator of the service provider’s\nagreement to the amendment; but\n\n(b) does not effect when the plan ceases to be in force under\nparagraph 187H(1)(b)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187j-ss-3-norm",
