    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187la",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "187LA Application of the Privacy Act 1988",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187la"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Privacy Act 1988 applies in relation to a service provider, as if\nthe service provider were an organisation within the meaning of\nthat Act, to the extent that the activities of the service provider\nrelate to retained data.\n\n(2) Information that is kept under this Part, or information that is in a\ndocument kept under this Part is taken, for the purposes of the\nPrivacy Act 1988, to be personal information about an individual if\nthe information relates to:\n\n(a) the individual; or\n\n(b) a communication to which the individual is a party.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Privacy Act 1988 applies in relation to a service provider, as if\nthe service provider were an organisation within the meaning of\nthat Act, to the extent that the activities of the service provider\nrelate to retained data.\n\n(2) Information that is kept under this Part, or information that is in a\ndocument kept under this Part is taken, for the purposes of the\nPrivacy Act 1988, to be personal information about an individual if\nthe information relates to:\n\n(a) the individual; or\n\n(b) a communication to which the individual is a party.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187la-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187la-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "246d311a678bdf06a9724da07e166a2b3ec664d544ee69e604d79b8ddd94be0c"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187la",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "187LA Application of the Privacy Act 1988",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 25,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Privacy Act 1988 applies in relation to a service provider, as if\nthe service provider were an organisation within the meaning of\nthat Act, to the extent that the activities of the service provider\nrelate to retained data.\n\n(2) Information that is kept under this Part, or information that is in a\ndocument kept under this Part is taken, for the purposes of the\nPrivacy Act 1988, to be personal information about an individual if\nthe information relates to:\n\n(a) the individual; or\n\n(b) a communication to which the individual is a party."
    },
