    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187n-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "187N(3) Review of operation of Part",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187n-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Until the review is completed, the head (however described) of an\nenforcement agency must keep:\n\n(a) all of the documents that he or she is required to retain under\nsection 185; and\n\n(b) all of the information that he or she is required, by\nparagraphs 186(1)(e) to (k), to include in a report under\nsubsection 186(1);\nrelating to the period starting on the commencement of this Part\nand ending when the review is completed.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Until the review is completed, the head (however described) of an\nenforcement agency must keep:\n\n(a) all of the documents that he or she is required to retain under\nsection 185; and\n\n(b) all of the information that he or she is required, by\nparagraphs 186(1)(e) to (k), to include in a report under\nsubsection 186(1);\nrelating to the period starting on the commencement of this Part\nand ending when the review is completed.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187n"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187n-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187n-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "38ca34e6fcbf3b1ee3b690a8f36491ea03f684f574e3dec96af32adf71d59fe5",
      "skos:note": "Agency must keep documents and information for a specified period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187n-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "187N(3) Review of operation of Part",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Until the review is completed, the head (however described) of an\nenforcement agency must keep:\n\n(a) all of the documents that he or she is required to retain under\nsection 185; and\n\n(b) all of the information that he or she is required, by\nparagraphs 186(1)(e) to (k), to include in a report under\nsubsection 186(1);\nrelating to the period starting on the commencement of this Part\nand ending when the review is completed."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187n-ss-3-norm",
