    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187n-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "187N(4) Review of operation of Part",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187n-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Until the review is completed, the Director-General of Security\nmust keep:\n\n(a) all of the authorisations made under Division 3 of Part 4-1;\nand\n\n(b) all of the information that he or she is required, by\nparagraphs 94(2A)(c) to (j) of the Australian Security\nIntelligence Organisation Act 1979, to include in a report\nreferred to in subsection 94(1) of that Act;\nrelating to the period starting on the commencement of this Part\nand ending when the review is completed.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Until the review is completed, the Director-General of Security\nmust keep:\n\n(a) all of the authorisations made under Division 3 of Part 4-1;\nand\n\n(b) all of the information that he or she is required, by\nparagraphs 94(2A)(c) to (j) of the Australian Security\nIntelligence Organisation Act 1979, to include in a report\nreferred to in subsection 94(1) of that Act;\nrelating to the period starting on the commencement of this Part\nand ending when the review is completed.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187n"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187n-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187n-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "45aa0a4f3e0e1fd39ae00e65478d3cd9b1593a43e3f9b168e17bab220cb65d0d",
      "skos:note": "Must keep authorisations and information related to a report."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187n-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "187N(4) Review of operation of Part",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Until the review is completed, the Director-General of Security\nmust keep:\n\n(a) all of the authorisations made under Division 3 of Part 4-1;\nand\n\n(b) all of the information that he or she is required, by\nparagraphs 94(2A)(c) to (j) of the Australian Security\nIntelligence Organisation Act 1979, to include in a report\nreferred to in subsection 94(1) of that Act;\nrelating to the period starting on the commencement of this Part\nand ending when the review is completed."
    },
