      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187p",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "187P Annual reports",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187p"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister must, as soon as practicable after each 30 June, cause\nto be prepared a written report on the operation of this Part during\nthe year ending on that 30 June.\n\n(1A) Without limiting the matters that may be included in a report under\nsubsection (1), it must include information about:\n\n(a) the costs to service providers of complying with this Part;\nand\n\n(b) the use of data retention implementation plans approved\nunder Division 2 of this Part.\n\n(2) A report under subsection (1) must be included in the report\nprepared under subsection 186(2) relating to the year ending on\nthat 30 June.\n\n(3) A report under subsection (1) must not be made in a manner that is\nlikely to enable the identification of a person.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 1  Data retention",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister must, as soon as practicable after each 30 June, cause\nto be prepared a written report on the operation of this Part during\nthe year ending on that 30 June.\n\n(1A) Without limiting the matters that may be included in a report under\nsubsection (1), it must include information about:\n\n(a) the costs to service providers of complying with this Part;\nand\n\n(b) the use of data retention implementation plans approved\nunder Division 2 of this Part.\n\n(2) A report under subsection (1) must be included in the report\nprepared under subsection 186(2) relating to the year ending on\nthat 30 June.\n\n(3) A report under subsection (1) must not be made in a manner that is\nlikely to enable the identification of a person.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 1  Data retention",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187p-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187p-ss-1a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187p-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187p-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c1c7b238c64bd41c963c72d61124ffc89478133953f1975c008516464c339ea7"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187p",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "187P Annual reports",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 27,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister must, as soon as practicable after each 30 June, cause\nto be prepared a written report on the operation of this Part during\nthe year ending on that 30 June.\n\n(1A) Without limiting the matters that may be included in a report under\nsubsection (1), it must include information about:\n\n(a) the costs to service providers of complying with this Part;\nand\n\n(b) the use of data retention implementation plans approved\nunder Division 2 of this Part.\n\n(2) A report under subsection (1) must be included in the report\nprepared under subsection 186(2) relating to the year ending on\nthat 30 June.\n\n(3) A report under subsection (1) must not be made in a manner that is\nlikely to enable the identification of a person.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 1  Data retention"
    },
