      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "(1A) Without limiting the matters that may be included in a report under\nsubsection (1), it must include information about:\n\n(a) the costs to service providers of complying with this Part;\nand\n\n(b) the use of data retention implementation plans approved\nunder Division 2 of this Part.",
      "skos:definition": "(1A) Without limiting the matters that may be included in a report under\nsubsection (1), it must include information about:\n\n(a) the costs to service providers of complying with this Part;\nand\n\n(b) the use of data retention implementation plans approved\nunder Division 2 of this Part.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187p"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187p-ss-1a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187p-ss-1a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fb9af65dfedaf7eeb3e4c0bdfee2c04bd18b9d055f76a5f14eb013a651b0866a",
      "skos:note": "Must include information about costs and data retention plans.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-187p-ss-1a",
