      "values:originalText": "A journalist information warrant issued under section 180L must\nspecify the period (not exceeding 6 months) for which it is to\nremain in force. The Minister may revoke the warrant at any time\nbefore the end of the specified period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-180n-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
