      "values:originalText": "(3) The chief officer of the agency may, in writing, nominate for the\npurposes of subparagraph (2)(b)(ii) an office or position in the\nagency that is involved in the management of the agency.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The chief officer of the agency may, in writing, nominate for the\npurposes of subparagraph (2)(b)(ii) an office or position in the\nagency that is involved in the management of the agency.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-180q"
      },
