      "skos:note": "Agency chief officer may nominate an office for agency management"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-180q-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "180Q(3) Enforcement agency may apply for a journalist information",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 44,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The chief officer of the agency may, in writing, nominate for the\npurposes of subparagraph (2)(b)(ii) an office or position in the\nagency that is involved in the management of the agency."
    },
