      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.45",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this section, the Part 4-1 issuing authority may:\n\n(a) administer an oath or affirmation; or\n\n(b) authorise another person to administer an oath or affirmation.\nThe oath or affirmation may be administered in person, or by\ntelephone, video call, video link or audio link.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 1  Data retention",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of this section, the Part 4-1 issuing authority may:\n\n(a) administer an oath or affirmation; or\n\n(b) authorise another person to administer an oath or affirmation.\nThe oath or affirmation may be administered in person, or by\ntelephone, video call, video link or audio link.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 1  Data retention",
