      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The chief officer of an enforcement agency may delegate his or her\npower under paragraph (1)(a) to a certifying officer of the agency.\nSubdivision D—Miscellaneous",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The chief officer of an enforcement agency may delegate his or her\npower under paragraph (1)(a) to a certifying officer of the agency.\nSubdivision D—Miscellaneous",
      "values:partOf": {
