      "values:originalText": "(2) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person discloses or uses a document; and\n\n(b) the document consists (wholly or partly) of any of the\nfollowing:\n\n(i) a journalist information warrant (other than such a\nwarrant that relates only to section 178A);\n\n(ii) the revocation of such a warrant.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 2 years.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 1  Data retention",
