    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 Existing information and documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to information\nor a document:\n\n(a) that is of a kind referred to in paragraph 187A(1)(a) or (b) of\nthe Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\nas amended by this Act; and\n\n(b) that a service provider was keeping, or causing to be kept,\nimmediately before the commencement of this item; and\n\n(c) in relation to which a period specified in section 187C of that\nAct as so amended had not expired before that\ncommencement.\n(2)\nHowever, this item does not require a service provider to create, or to\nhave created, any information or document that was not created by the\noperation, before that commencement, of a service to which Part 5-1A\nof that Act as so amended applies.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to information\nor a document:\n\n(a) that is of a kind referred to in paragraph 187A(1)(a) or (b) of\nthe Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\nas amended by this Act; and\n\n(b) that a service provider was keeping, or causing to be kept,\nimmediately before the commencement of this item; and\n\n(c) in relation to which a period specified in section 187C of that\nAct as so amended had not expired before that\ncommencement.\n(2)\nHowever, this item does not require a service provider to create, or to\nhave created, any information or document that was not created by the\noperation, before that commencement, of a service to which Part 5-1A\nof that Act as so amended applies.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-7-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4029a29f8eab251781569ed59cb7089c11fcc0b13b394c640b62b42f06291dc3",
      "skos:note": "Applicable amendments for existing information and documents"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 Existing information and documents",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to information\nor a document:\n\n(a) that is of a kind referred to in paragraph 187A(1)(a) or (b) of\nthe Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\nas amended by this Act; and\n\n(b) that a service provider was keeping, or causing to be kept,\nimmediately before the commencement of this item; and\n\n(c) in relation to which a period specified in section 187C of that\nAct as so amended had not expired before that\ncommencement.\n(2)\nHowever, this item does not require a service provider to create, or to\nhave created, any information or document that was not created by the\noperation, before that commencement, of a service to which Part 5-1A\nof that Act as so amended applies."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-7-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-7"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8 Reducing the period for keeping information or documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nA service provider must not, before the commencement Part 5-1A of the\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 as amended by\nthis Act, reduce the period for which it keeps or causes to be kept any\ninformation or document that the service provider will, after that\ncommencement, be required by that Part to keep or cause to be kept.\n(2)\nThis item is taken to be a civil penalty provision for the purposes of the\nTelecommunications Act 1997, as if it had been so declared by a\nprovision of that Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nA service provider must not, before the commencement Part 5-1A of the\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 as amended by\nthis Act, reduce the period for which it keeps or causes to be kept any\ninformation or document that the service provider will, after that\ncommencement, be required by that Part to keep or cause to be kept.\n(2)\nThis item is taken to be a civil penalty provision for the purposes of the\nTelecommunications Act 1997, as if it had been so declared by a\nprovision of that Act.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "241d59159abccda60b151d3dfc0e2d6ff46e4d601b13dbe8c44b3000946c3317",
      "skos:note": "Service provider must not reduce period for keeping information or documents before specified commencement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 Reducing the period for keeping information or documents",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nA service provider must not, before the commencement Part 5-1A of the\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 as amended by\nthis Act, reduce the period for which it keeps or causes to be kept any\ninformation or document that the service provider will, after that\ncommencement, be required by that Part to keep or cause to be kept.\n(2)\nThis item is taken to be a civil penalty provision for the purposes of the\nTelecommunications Act 1997, as if it had been so declared by a\nprovision of that Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-8"
      },
