      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9 Applications made before commencement of Part 5-1A",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nAt any time after this Act receives the Royal Assent, a service provider\nmay apply for either or both of the following:\n\n(a) approval of:\n\n(i) a data retention implementation plan; or\n\n(ii) an amendment of a data retention implementation plan;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nData retention  Schedule 1\nApplication provisions  Part 3\n\nNo. 39, 2015\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data\nRetention) Act 2015\n\nunder Division 2 of Part 5-1A of the Telecommunications\n(Interception and Access) Act 1979 as amended by this Act;\n\n(b) a decision under subsection 187K(1) or 187KA(2) of that Act\nas so amended.\n(2)\nParagraph (1)(a) of this item does not apply to an application for\napproval of a data retention implementation plan unless the application\nwould, if made after the commencement of Part 5-1A of that Act as so\namended, have complied with section 187E of that Act as so amended.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nAt any time after this Act receives the Royal Assent, a service provider\nmay apply for either or both of the following:\n\n(a) approval of:\n\n(i) a data retention implementation plan; or\n\n(ii) an amendment of a data retention implementation plan;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nData retention  Schedule 1\nApplication provisions  Part 3\n\nNo. 39, 2015\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data\nRetention) Act 2015\n\nunder Division 2 of Part 5-1A of the Telecommunications\n(Interception and Access) Act 1979 as amended by this Act;\n\n(b) a decision under subsection 187K(1) or 187KA(2) of that Act\nas so amended.\n(2)\nParagraph (1)(a) of this item does not apply to an application for\napproval of a data retention implementation plan unless the application\nwould, if made after the commencement of Part 5-1A of that Act as so\namended, have complied with section 187E of that Act as so amended.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-9-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-9-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-9-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9dcd8ef1077b205e0d25241e194afab88029273d520b6c89ef511231b4469dda",
      "skos:note": "Service provider may apply for approval of data retention implementation plan or amendment."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-1-sec-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9 Applications made before commencement of Part 5-1A",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nAt any time after this Act receives the Royal Assent, a service provider\nmay apply for either or both of the following:\n\n(a) approval of:\n\n(i) a data retention implementation plan; or\n\n(ii) an amendment of a data retention implementation plan;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nData retention  Schedule 1\nApplication provisions  Part 3\n\nNo. 39, 2015\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data\nRetention) Act 2015\n\nunder Division 2 of Part 5-1A of the Telecommunications\n(Interception and Access) Act 1979 as amended by this Act;\n\n(b) a decision under subsection 187K(1) or 187KA(2) of that Act\nas so amended.\n(2)\nParagraph (1)(a) of this item does not apply to an application for\napproval of a data retention implementation plan unless the application\nwould, if made after the commencement of Part 5-1A of that Act as so\namended, have complied with section 187E of that Act as so amended."
    },
