    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-2-sec-176a-ss-3b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "176A(3B) Meaning of enforcement agency",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-2-sec-176a-ss-3b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.64",
      "values:originalText": "(3B) The Minister must not make the declaration unless the Minister is\nsatisfied on reasonable grounds that the functions of the authority\nor body include:\n\n(a) enforcement of the criminal law; or\n\n(b) administering a law imposing a pecuniary penalty; or\n\n(c) administering a law relating to the protection of the public\nrevenue.",
      "skos:definition": "(3B) The Minister must not make the declaration unless the Minister is\nsatisfied on reasonable grounds that the functions of the authority\nor body include:\n\n(a) enforcement of the criminal law; or\n\n(b) administering a law imposing a pecuniary penalty; or\n\n(c) administering a law relating to the protection of the public\nrevenue.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-2-sec-176a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-2-sec-176a-ss-3b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-2-sec-176a-ss-3b-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-2-sec-176a-ss-3b-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-2-sec-176a-ss-3b-logic-alleninterval-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-2-sec-176a-ss-3b-logic-ltl-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "47dceef6325b6032839baf5921c6213fb1bbccc5c1605b93929302c636caa473",
      "skos:note": "Minister must be satisfied on reasonable grounds before making declaration."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-2-sec-176a-ss-3b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "176A(3B) Meaning of enforcement agency",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(3B) The Minister must not make the declaration unless the Minister is\nsatisfied on reasonable grounds that the functions of the authority\nor body include:\n\n(a) enforcement of the criminal law; or\n\n(b) administering a law imposing a pecuniary penalty; or\n\n(c) administering a law relating to the protection of the public\nrevenue."
    },
    {
