      "skos:definition": "(4A) For the purposes of subparagraphs (4)(c)(ii) and (iii), the protection\nof personal information provided by the scheme must:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 2  Restricting access to stored communications and telecommunications data",
