        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1b8c25806f878902cf90a93b25efa4cc5174e8fb894135a2f7fb7eac0e3cc453",
      "skos:note": "Restrict access to stored communications and telecommunications data"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-2-sec-176a-ss-4a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "176A(4A) Meaning of enforcement agency",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(4A) For the purposes of subparagraphs (4)(c)(ii) and (iii), the protection\nof personal information provided by the scheme must:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 2  Restricting access to stored communications and telecommunications data"
    },
    {
