      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.68",
      "values:originalText": "Commission)\nOmit “Misconduct”, substitute “Corruption”.",
      "skos:definition": "Commission)\nOmit “Misconduct”, substitute “Corruption”.",
