      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) an authority or body issued a certificate under section 107U or 130 of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 before the commencement of this Schedule;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the certificate continues in force as if the authority or body were a criminal law-enforcement agency."
    },
    {
