      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) on that commencement, the authority or body is not a criminal law-enforcement agency (whether or not it is an enforcement agency);",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the certificate continues in force as if the authority or body were a criminal law-enforcement agency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-2-sec-51-logic-deontic-3",
