      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.82",
      "values:originalText": "(5) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) does not require the Ombudsman to\ninspect all of the records of an enforcement agency that are\nrelevant to the matters referred to in paragraphs (1)(a) and (b).",
      "skos:definition": "(5) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) does not require the Ombudsman to\ninspect all of the records of an enforcement agency that are\nrelevant to the matters referred to in paragraphs (1)(a) and (b).",
