    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186e",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "186E Application of Ombudsman Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-3-sec-186e"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.85",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Section 11A of the Ombudsman Act 1976 does not apply in\nrelation to the exercise or proposed exercise of a power, or the\nperformance or the proposed performance of a function, of the\nOmbudsman under this Chapter.\n\n(2) A reference in section 19 of the Ombudsman Act 1976 to the\nOmbudsman’s operations does not include a reference to anything\nthat an inspecting officer has done or omitted to do under this\nChapter.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 3  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Section 11A of the Ombudsman Act 1976 does not apply in\nrelation to the exercise or proposed exercise of a power, or the\nperformance or the proposed performance of a function, of the\nOmbudsman under this Chapter.\n\n(2) A reference in section 19 of the Ombudsman Act 1976 to the\nOmbudsman’s operations does not include a reference to anything\nthat an inspecting officer has done or omitted to do under this\nChapter.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 3  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman",
      "cml:hasPart": [
