      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.86",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the Ombudsman has obtained under this Act information relating\nto an authority of a State or Territory, the Ombudsman may give\nthe information to another authority of that State or Territory (an\ninspecting authority) that:\n\n(a) has powers under the law of that State or Territory; and\n\n(b) has the function of making inspections of a similar kind to\nthose provided for in section 186B of this Act when the\ninspecting authority is exercising those powers.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If the Ombudsman has obtained under this Act information relating\nto an authority of a State or Territory, the Ombudsman may give\nthe information to another authority of that State or Territory (an\ninspecting authority) that:\n\n(a) has powers under the law of that State or Territory; and\n\n(b) has the function of making inspections of a similar kind to\nthose provided for in section 186B of this Act when the\ninspecting authority is exercising those powers.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186f"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186f-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186f-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "111f20d5ae5d0faeb64d2a558e031d97c0d95d8c3e9e93392eb73de9620e64e7",
      "skos:note": "Exchange of information between Ombudsman and State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-3-sec-186f-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "186F(1) Exchange of information between Ombudsman and State",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 86,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the Ombudsman has obtained under this Act information relating\nto an authority of a State or Territory, the Ombudsman may give\nthe information to another authority of that State or Territory (an\ninspecting authority) that:\n\n(a) has powers under the law of that State or Territory; and\n\n(b) has the function of making inspections of a similar kind to\nthose provided for in section 186B of this Act when the\ninspecting authority is exercising those powers."
    },
