      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.86",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Ombudsman may receive, from an inspecting authority,\ninformation relevant to the performance of the Ombudsman’s\nfunctions under this Act.",
