    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186j-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "186J(5) Reports",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-3-sec-186j-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.87",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If, as a result of an inspection under this Chapter of the records of\nan enforcement agency, the Ombudsman is of the opinion that an\nofficer of the agency has contravened a provision of this Act, the\nOmbudsman may include in his or her report on the inspection a\nreport on the contravention.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 3  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If, as a result of an inspection under this Chapter of the records of\nan enforcement agency, the Ombudsman is of the opinion that an\nofficer of the agency has contravened a provision of this Act, the\nOmbudsman may include in his or her report on the inspection a\nreport on the contravention.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 3  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186j"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
