        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186j-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4e6a57fd91346e15f04e3fd6d6e6ae21ce9b74460ac23c7a32f895392dec7e3b",
      "skos:note": "Ombudsman may include report on contravention in inspection report."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-3-sec-186j-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "186J(5) Reports",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 87,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If, as a result of an inspection under this Chapter of the records of\nan enforcement agency, the Ombudsman is of the opinion that an\nofficer of the agency has contravened a provision of this Act, the\nOmbudsman may include in his or her report on the inspection a\nreport on the contravention.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\nSchedule 3  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman"
    },
    {
