    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8 Existing inspections by the Ombudsman",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-3-sec-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.89",
      "values:originalText": "If an inspection that the Ombudsman was conducting before the\ncommencement of this Schedule under section 152 of the\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 was not\nfinished before that commencement, after that commencement:\n\n(a) the inspection is taken to be an inspection conducted under\nChapter 4A of that Act as amended by this Act; and\n\n(b) anything done under that section in relation to the inspection\nbefore that commencement is taken to have been done under\nChapter 4A of that Act as so amended.",
      "skos:definition": "If an inspection that the Ombudsman was conducting before the\ncommencement of this Schedule under section 152 of the\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 was not\nfinished before that commencement, after that commencement:\n\n(a) the inspection is taken to be an inspection conducted under\nChapter 4A of that Act as amended by this Act; and\n\n(b) anything done under that section in relation to the inspection\nbefore that commencement is taken to have been done under\nChapter 4A of that Act as so amended.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-8-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4f70c8a91206a32b0263533cac8dc8d94cbbb8ad2cf6ef841d6814c525ed5b9f",
      "skos:note": "Continuation of inspection under amended Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-3-sec-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 Existing inspections by the Ombudsman",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 89,
      "values:originalText": "If an inspection that the Ombudsman was conducting before the\ncommencement of this Schedule under section 152 of the\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 was not\nfinished before that commencement, after that commencement:\n\n(a) the inspection is taken to be an inspection conducted under\nChapter 4A of that Act as amended by this Act; and\n\n(b) anything done under that section in relation to the inspection\nbefore that commencement is taken to have been done under\nChapter 4A of that Act as so amended."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-8"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9 Reports",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-3-sec-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.89",
      "values:originalText": "If:\n\n(a) an inspection that the Ombudsman was conducting before the\ncommencement of this Schedule under section 152 of the\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 was\nfinished before that commencement; but\n\n(b) the inspection was not the dealt with before that\ncommencement in any report to the Minister under\nsection 153 of that Act;\nsection 186J of that Act as amended by this Act applies in relation to the\ninspection as if it had been conducted under section 186B of that Act as\nso amended.",
      "skos:definition": "If:\n\n(a) an inspection that the Ombudsman was conducting before the\ncommencement of this Schedule under section 152 of the\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 was\nfinished before that commencement; but\n\n(b) the inspection was not the dealt with before that\ncommencement in any report to the Minister under\nsection 153 of that Act;\nsection 186J of that Act as amended by this Act applies in relation to the\ninspection as if it had been conducted under section 186B of that Act as\nso amended.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-9-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8bb732fe0536052ae7bededd3fcf49c3b78efb9848dd850e25807f720450d822",
      "skos:note": "Conditional commencement of section 186J of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-3-sec-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9 Reports",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 89,
      "values:originalText": "If:\n\n(a) an inspection that the Ombudsman was conducting before the\ncommencement of this Schedule under section 152 of the\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 was\nfinished before that commencement; but\n\n(b) the inspection was not the dealt with before that\ncommencement in any report to the Minister under\nsection 153 of that Act;\nsection 186J of that Act as amended by this Act applies in relation to the\ninspection as if it had been conducted under section 186B of that Act as\nso amended."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-9-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-9"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-10",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 Obligation to keep records",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-3-sec-10"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf, p.89",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nSections 151 and 186A of the Telecommunications (Interception and\nAccess) Act 1979 as amended by this Act do not apply in relation to\nanything done before the commencement of this Schedule.\n(2)\nDespite the repeal of sections 150A and 151 of the Telecommunications\n(Interception and Access) Act 1979 by this Act, those sections continue\nto apply in relation to things done before the commencement of this\nSchedule as if those sections had not been repealed.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\n\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data\nRetention) Act 2015\nNo. 39, 2015\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 30 October 2014\nSenate on 24 March 2015]\n\n(242/14)\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nSections 151 and 186A of the Telecommunications (Interception and\nAccess) Act 1979 as amended by this Act do not apply in relation to\nanything done before the commencement of this Schedule.\n(2)\nDespite the repeal of sections 150A and 151 of the Telecommunications\n(Interception and Access) Act 1979 by this Act, those sections continue\nto apply in relation to things done before the commencement of this\nSchedule as if those sections had not been repealed.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\n\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data\nRetention) Act 2015\nNo. 39, 2015\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 30 October 2014\nSenate on 24 March 2015]\n\n(242/14)\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-10-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-10-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-10-logic-ltl-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-10-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-10-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b7f938f8d16fa4750e8f4361c4ba46bf3a83a73f23da97eb690f56bf8eb97324",
      "skos:note": "Exempts pre-commencement actions from certain sections of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015#sch-3-sec-10",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 Obligation to keep records",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 89,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nSections 151 and 186A of the Telecommunications (Interception and\nAccess) Act 1979 as amended by this Act do not apply in relation to\nanything done before the commencement of this Schedule.\n(2)\nDespite the repeal of sections 150A and 151 of the Telecommunications\n(Interception and Access) Act 1979 by this Act, those sections continue\nto apply in relation to things done before the commencement of this\nSchedule as if those sections had not been repealed.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039\n\n\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data\nRetention) Act 2015\nNo. 39, 2015\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 30 October 2014\nSenate on 24 March 2015]\n\n(242/14)\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039"
    },
    {
